The draft is available under the &quot;Blue Ringed Octopus&quot; tab.</p>
<p>I'm bringing this really old draft out of retirement! Thanks in advance. It's a biological research thriller with some eldritch fridge horror thrown in for color. You know, the usual. Formatting note: the spacing in the second interview log is broken and I can't figure out how to fix it. Any help appreciated.</p>
