<p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">[placeholder, will crit within 48 hours]</span></p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Line&nbsp;By&nbsp;Line</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
